                  <nc xml:id="m-2beeedbc-ba98-4ff2-8189-c15180b73449" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-5ee78ab5-2d81-44a6-8523-d8257ede31e2" facs="#m-ec0fdd84-1482-4f2f-b130-de4561d25101" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-3c4d44a2-bfbb-4bc9-b5d4-eed2dc3b91c4"><lg xml:id="m-3c509676-6270-46ba-95d0-d4d8521efcd5"><l xml:id="m-5b9f1a7a-1efd-44a4-a96a-bdc9416e01e0" facs="#m-d5e368a2-8a7d-4bdf-8469-72312140e776" label="ambiguous">1652</l><l xml:id="m-ed313bbd-dd45-4306-85c4-86161776a346" facs="#m-72c468d7-4781-4e67-bdfd-2941e9018786" label="ambiguous">September 29.</l><l xml:id="m-fcdf8efc-d4a7-485d-b350-defc252f50a7" facs="#m-64ef856b-7da6-487e-89ff-a8b17fdb6781" label="ambiguous">   --- =. ===-=e--ca---. mca</l><l xml:id="m-49b8da61-0092-46df-a2d7-6f710ccc8298" facs="#m-e2b3f076-cbcd-4b60-817f-d6ecc59a1379" label="ambiguous">SEPTEMBER 29.</l><l xml:id="m-aff1cd89-e16b-4b8c-b156-f6af537903f0" facs="#m-c4250bb1-eb73-44b4-b5e1-2f9092df956c" label="text-like">DEDICATION OF THE CHURCH</l><l xml:id="m-8fb277d0-3aed-4ccc-9537-be6a3aa9e7b6" facs="#m-e1fc1de6-e2f5-428d-a352-6d765e96c769" label="text-like">OF ST. MICHAEL, THE ARCHANGEL</l><l xml:id="m-288fa3b3-1b2f-4d67-a8f4-9ecba8902c4b" facs="#m-87bb0c57-1ee8-4dbd-bebd-0ad05424c20a" label="text-like">Double of the First Class.</l><l xml:id="m-dc61c218-1b0d-460d-9f82-bc2642cf58dd" facs="#m-75b5f40f-7422-4bc5-8c62-2a5719f81075" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-44a6a75c-d585-4db9-82c9-dcc420d0cddf" facs="#m-810c331d-8e9c-45d4-8a94-a133edd807f1" label="lyrics-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1659, except the fifth psalm, which is Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-7a8de52e-a41a-4e49-8c2e-db1535582539" facs="#m-24df7bab-7b8e-4f55-9bb3-cb14988f62bf" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. 7. c. p. 168, and the following:</l><l xml:id="m-2107559d-540f-49f6-81c1-08e95ca9fcea" facs="#m-78ffc623-e128-4cb4-bc64-a32d75852858" label="lyrics-like">v. Stétit Angelus juxta áram témpli.</l><l xml:id="m-4dec1687-6ed2-4f49-9723-f34873120b93" facs="#m-bd60b24f-fa61-4754-9924-af73149ef78d" label="lyrics-like">R. Hábens thuribulum áureum in mánu súa.</l><l xml:id="m-a42fa5f1-d63d-4ab5-ba76-3884e6a69892" facs="#m-a08d0509-7268-4888-b4eb-cac00a90ccee" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-df9016cd-f11e-4a5a-a61d-4e409ed3a799" facs="#m-42215abc-7b6b-4408-b2f8-81dd36191c3b" label="ambiguous">Ant. S.G</l><l xml:id="m-f8ca367d-25f2-4643-a65b-d98924b12677" facs="#m-542d9f7b-2ca1-4964-b3b4-1b5e6f90da1b" label="lyrics-like">DUM sácrum mysté-ri-um* cérne-ret Jo-ánnes,</l><l xml:id="m-f38513a6-be55-41db-8b32-189dafeb904b" facs="#m-0fe970f3-4d4f-4a87-96f0-7c5870cd30b9" label="lyrics-like">Archánge-lus Mícha-el túba cé-ci-nit: Ignósce Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-15433c74-f79e-498b-83d7-0e4905ed8099" facs="#m-8aeb27e9-558d-4e59-9988-fbe72bc41ef0" label="lyrics-like">ne Dé-us nóster, qui ápe-ris líbrum, et sólvis signácu-la</l><l xml:id="m-c7b42da2-8950-43e6-833b-eebc642fdf3d" facs="#m-8efa1641-0fc4-4077-9a79-65e0acca7792" label="lyrics-like">é-ius, alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-cd850dd1-a9ac-49cd-8c48-b5ae3fe9cc7b" facs="#m-f898d23d-22ce-428b-8294-1330c3893faa" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212, or p. 218.</l><l xml:id="m-0e705966-3106-454b-aed1-df620f0cdd0c" facs="#m-25d9f43c-42ec-4cfd-9027-d598ccca3637" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui miro órdine. p. 1654.</l><l xml:id="m-64f9d964-8683-4257-b97a-94e7d9d320f5" facs="#m-4a7fb767-5bce-4ce6-a5f8-0927e38340f0" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-740de198-a238-4664-8895-73f050d94381" facs="#m-00687c19-d204-4534-bad2-d38b2a5eb9cf" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Dum praeliarétur. p. 1659. — Chapter of Vespers. Significávit.</l><l xml:id="m-819a80a7-a9ec-4a7c-98b3-4adcf10a80ac" facs="#m-a8fe062e-f2b2-4d56-8952-755ec85be3ce" label="ambiguous">p. 1660.</l><l xml:id="m-fca7e045-bd5e-4753-b925-099655bee786" facs="#m-d6fb3b98-0b85-469b-a1d1-60a827f857d6" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-610bef56-29f1-41c2-af43-ebcfb36410dc" facs="#m-88d9a898-2e21-4347-bb15-39bd3519c722" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-fd79582b-419b-43fd-be31-4170b7bff6b5" facs="#m-986ac1ad-a9ed-49be-90af-df28b3ab45a4" label="lyrics-like">Té-tit Ange-lus “Juxta á- ram témpli. V. Hábens</l><l xml:id="m-839e22d3-c5b9-4cab-af2e-b966cb4a95c2" facs="#m-261abf0a-0a8b-4f71-a670-549d3fb3529a" label="lyrics-like">thu-ríbu-lum áure-um in mánu sú-a. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
